# sys-griseous-orb (decomp party menu UpdatePokemonWithItem, PartyMenuCB_TakeItem,
# BoxPokemon_SetGiratinaForm): a constructed start in Turnback Cave's Giratina room with an Altered Giratina and the
# Griseous Orb (m6-turnback-giratina-caught picks it up in the revisit room). The party menu's ITEM → GIVE puts the
# orb on Giratina: after "… now carries the Griseous Orb", the form change: "… changed form!", Origin, its ability
# (Levitate) and stats, the form in the Pokédex. A reload keeps all of it; TAKE brings the orb back, and Altered.
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_GIRATINA 47 platinum:MOVE_SHADOW_FORCE platinum:MOVE_DRAGON_CLAW
give item platinum:ITEM_GRISEOUS_ORB 1
set flag platinum:FLAG_HIDE_TURNBACK_CAVE_GIRATINA_ROOM_GIRATINA true
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_TURNBACK_CAVE_GIRATINA_ROOM 11 16 up
until idle
+0 assert state party[0].form 0
+0 assert state party[0].ability "platinum:ABILITY_PRESSURE"
+1 press x
+1 release x
until app start-menu
+1 tap entry:0
+1 assert app party
+1 tap slot:0
+1 tap menu:2
+1 tap menu:0
+1 assert app bag
+1 tap pocket:0
+1 tap row:0
+1 assert state party[0].heldItem "platinum:ITEM_GRISEOUS_ORB"
+0 assert state party[0].form 1
+0 assert state party[0].ability "platinum:ABILITY_LEVITATE"
+30 press a
+1 release a
+0 assert state pokedex.forms.platinum:SPECIES_GIRATINA[1].form 1
+90 press a
+1 release a
+30 press b
+1 release b
+30 press b
+1 release b
until app none 300
until idle 300
+0 reload
+0 assert state party[0].form 1
+0 assert state party[0].heldItem "platinum:ITEM_GRISEOUS_ORB"
+1 press x
+1 release x
until app start-menu
+1 tap entry:0
+1 tap slot:0
+1 tap menu:2
+1 tap menu:1
+1 assert state party[0].heldItem null
+0 assert state party[0].form 0
+0 assert state party[0].ability "platinum:ABILITY_PRESSURE"
+0 assert state bag.items[item="platinum:ITEM_GRISEOUS_ORB"].count 1
+30 press a
+1 release a
+30 press b
+1 release b
+30 press b
+1 release b
+30 press b
+1 release b
until app none 300
until idle 300
